{"id":"vod_bf_8732","vodId":"8732","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"恶魔高校D×D第二季","name_cn":"恶魔高校D×D第二季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-9/a6e6b3c6e54b850b3e7698d0d46d89fd.jpg"},"summary":"兵藤一诚（梶裕贵 饰）是学校里出了名的好色男，因此遭到了诸多女生的嫌恶，某日，一位名叫天野夕麻（生天目仁美 配音）的神秘美少女突然出在了一诚的面前，她不仅向一诚告了白，还提出了约会的请求。难道一诚的春天就要这样来临了？　　让一诚没有想到的是，在初次的约会之中，自己竟然被天野夕麻杀死了。原来，夕麻的真实身份是下级堕天使丽娜丽，她接受了教会的命令，专门前来刺杀一诚。就在一诚魂飞魄散之际，学园里的公认校花莉亚丝（日笠阳子 配音）出现在了他的面前，她使用恶魔棋子将一诚复活，并使其成为了自己的眷属。教会刺杀一诚的真实目的究竟是什么呢？一诚又将怎样面对死而复生的人生呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 18:42:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/emogaoxiaoDDdierji/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22